       "en": "Many Americans don’t answer calls from numbers they don’t know (there are a lot of spam calls). So you will leave **voicemails** often. A good voicemail has 4 parts: **who you are**, **why you’re calling**, **your number (twice, slowly)**, and **thanks**. “Hi, this is Claire Martin, a new patient. I’m calling to reschedule my appointment on Thursday. Please call me back at 813-555-0179. Again, 813-555-0179. Thanks so much!”",
